I created LAhE, and to be perfectly honest, I am discontent with the actual
choice of word for it. It should have been something like ko'oi or ko'ei. I
also agree that its status as a LAhE is quite silly. Rather than recycle a
word that was poorly chosen to begin with, let's use something that will
actually look like an attitudinal. How about {.e'ei} ? It looks like {.ei}
for "obligation" but it will mean "command". Seeing as usage of xa'e is
very limited, I simply propose that we remove it entirely. LAhE-based
imperatives is silly.

.i mi'e la tsani mu'o


